rWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#333\"></marker></defs> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ 정면도 — 반달(半月) 형상<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">L=전체 길이 · h=높이 · d0=적용 축 지름</span></p>":"<svg width=\"220\" height=\"150\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 150\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"> <path d=\"M20 40 A55 55 0 0 1 130 40 L130 100 A55 40 0 0 1 20 100 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"> <text x=\"80\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\" font-style=\"italic\">d3</text> <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"16\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <text x=\"68\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <line x1=\"8\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <text x=\"0\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\" transform=\"rotate(-90 8 55)\">h</text> <defs><marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#333\"></marker></defs> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 8px 0 0;\">↑ Front view — half-moon shape<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">L = overall length · h = height · d0 = applicable shaft diameter</span></p>","<strong>재질 · 용도</strong><br> 용도: 축 테이퍼 부분 고정 &nbsp;·&nbsp; 재질: SM45C, STS 304":"<strong>Material · Application</strong><br> Application: Fixing tapered shaft sections &nbsp;·&nbsp; Material: SM45C, STS 304"},"ja":{"반달 키 (Woodruff Keys) | [회사명] 베어링":"半月キー(Woodruff Keys) | [会社名]ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Woodruff Keys</p> <h2>반달 키 (Woodruff Keys)</h2> <p> 축 구멍을 반달 모양으로 가공해 끼우는 키로, 키 자체가 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">축의 테이퍼 홈에서 자유롭게 기울어질 수 있어</strong> 축과 보스의 키홈 가공 오차를 흡수합니다. 소형 축·테이퍼 축 고정에 주로 사용됩니다. </p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Woodruff Keys</p> <h2>半月キー(Woodruff Keys)</h2> <p> 軸穴を半月形に加工して差し込むキーで、キー自体が<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">軸のテーパー溝内で自由に傾くことができるため</strong>、軸とボスのキー溝加工誤差を吸収します。小型軸・テーパー軸の固定に主に使用されます。 </p>","<svg width=\"220\" height=\"150\" viewbox=\"0 0 220 150\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\"></line> <path d=\"M20 40 A55 55 0 0 1 130 40 L130 100 A55 40 0 0 1 20 100 Z\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path> <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"></line> <line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"></line> <text x=\"80\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\" font-style=\"italic\">d3</text> <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"16\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"68\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\">L</text> <line x1=\"8\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line> <text x=\"0\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#222\" transform=\"rotate(-90 8 55)\">h</text> <defs><marker id=\"arrow\" markerwidth=\"6\" markerheight=\"6\" refx=\"5\" refy=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#333\"></path></marker></defs> </svg> <p style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-sub); ma